<title>NETHERLANDS: RABOBANK FIRST HALF NET PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>RABOBANK FIRST HALF NET PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June</p>
<p>30. (In millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 853    vs 702</p>
<p>    Net operating profit		   866   vs  709</p>
<p>    Revenue (billions)			 4.70 vs   4.10</p>
<p>    Net interest income (billions)	 3.41 vs   3.08</p>
<p>    Fee income				 624    vs 526</p>
<p>    Result from trading		    165    vs  96</p>
<p>    Total expenses (billions)		3.44 vs   3.07</p>
<p>Note - Rabobank Nederland BA is an unlisted co-operative bank.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
